nodecode-jp-corporate is a rewrite of TakeshiTGAL's TakeshiTGAL/hermes-plugin-jp-corporate:
https://github.com/TakeshiTGAL/hermes-plugin-jp-corporate
commit fc0e16c2924d00774957c516f5eb14016228b91d
